PDFs are drawn with pdf.js (https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js), under the
Apache License 2.0, with its WebAssembly decoders (JBIG2, OpenJPEG, qcms),
each under its own license. Those license texts ship with Relay, next to
the files they cover (pdfjs/LICENSE and pdfjs/wasm/LICENSE_*).
